WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.216
Taco: Maxie, I think we should look around the ship

2
00:00:06.217 --> 00:00:07.759
now. Maxie: You’re right,

3
00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:09.963
Taco. It was nice meeting you, Lulu.

4
00:00:09.964 --> 00:00:11.836
But we have to go.

5
00:00:11.837 --> 00:00:15.390
Lulu: Can I come, please?

6
00:00:15.391 --> 00:00:17.305
Maxie: I don’t know, Lulu.

7
00:00:18.519 --> 00:00:18.683
You’re too big!

8
00:00:18.684 --> 00:00:22.436
What if someone sees you out of your cage? Lulu:

9
00:00:22.437 --> 00:00:25.937
But I’d love to see the ocean.

10
00:00:25.938 --> 00:00:32.491
I’d love to smell the fresh air . . . Taco:

11
00:00:32.492 --> 00:00:35.226
Okay, okay! Don’t cry!

12
00:00:35.227 --> 00:00:39.113
Maxie! Let her come with us. Maxie:

13
00:00:39.114 --> 00:00:48.493
As long as you are quiet and stay right next to me.

14
00:00:48.494 --> 00:00:52.022
Lulu: I’m free! I’m free!

15
00:00:52.023 --> 00:00:54.837
I’m so happy! Maxie

16
00:00:54.838 --> 00:00:59.033
and Taco: LULU! SSSHHHHHH!

17
00:00:59.034 --> 00:01:04.521
Lulu: Just look at the ocean!

18
00:01:04.522 --> 00:01:07.597
It’s so grand! Taco:

19
00:01:07.598 --> 00:01:10.855
Maxie! This is definitely another ship!

20
00:01:10.856 --> 00:01:13.046
We are on the wrong ship! Maxie:

21
00:01:13.047 --> 00:01:15.717
There’s nothing we can do now, Taco.

22
00:01:15.718 --> 00:01:19.168
At least we are safe. Lulu:

23
00:01:19.169 --> 00:01:22.376
Oh, look! Taco:

24
00:01:22.377 --> 00:01:27.681
Land ahoy! Land ahoy! Lulu:

25
00:01:27.682 --> 00:01:30.335
What does that mean?

26
00:01:30.336 --> 00:01:33.341
Taco: It’s what sailors say when they see land.

27
00:01:33.342 --> 00:01:35.295
Land ahoy! Lulu:

28
00:01:35.296 --> 00:01:40.330
Land ahoy!

29
00:01:40.331 --> 00:01:46.207
Man 1: Gotcha! How did you escape!

30
00:01:46.208 --> 00:01:48.971
Man 3: Where did the cat and bird come

31
00:01:48.972 --> 00:01:50.187
from? Man 4: I don’t

32
00:01:50.188 --> 00:01:53.051
know. I thought we only had a panda bear.

33
00:01:53.052 --> 00:01:58.199
Man 2: Oh well, let’s take them too.

